  "releaseNotes": "Adds opt-in --diagnostic-locations evidence to JSON and SARIF validation reports while preserving the default report shape, schema versions, commands and exit codes.\nImproves relationship diagnostics and cross-platform Git path handling.\nShips the internal, non-packable AdrGuard.Core assembly used directly by the CLI and MCP without creating a public Core package.\nFull release notes: https://github.com/rodri-oliveira-dev/adr-guard/releases/tag/v1.9.0",
